---
import '../../styles/global.css';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-tw">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>關於小象 | elephlow</title>
  <meta name="description" content="關於小象（Elephlow）與「推開部屋的門」電子報" />
</head>
<body>

  <main class="home-window">

    <header class="window-titlebar">
      <div class="titlebar-left">
        <span class="title-dots">● ● ●</span>
        <span class="titlebar-text">elephlow.cc / 關於小象</span>
      </div>
      <div class="titlebar-right">
        <a href="/zh-cn/about" class="lang-link">简</a>
        <a href="/zh-tw/about" class="lang-link lang-active">繁</a>
        <a href="/en/about" class="lang-link">EN</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="window-content about-layout">

      <!-- 左侧：像素小象 + persona + 興趣領域 -->
      <aside class="about-left">

        <div class="elephant-portrait">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 100 80" xmlns="[http://www.w3.org/2000/svg](http://www.w3.org/2000/svg)" shape-rendering="crispEdges">
            <text x="8" y="12" fill="#FFB6D9" font-size="10">✦</text>
            <text x="78" y="16" fill="#C7B3E8" font-size="8">✦</text>
            <text x="6" y="65" fill="#B5E8E0" font-size="9">·</text>
            <text x="82" y="60" fill="#FFE9B6" font-size="10">·</text>
            <rect x="30" y="26" width="8" height="10" fill="#C7B3E8"/>
            <rect x="58" y="26" width="8" height="10" fill="#C7B3E8"/>
            <rect x="34" y="24" width="28" height="18" fill="#C7B3E8"/>
            <rect x="48" y="40" width="6" height="14" fill="#C7B3E8"/>
            <rect x="48" y="52" width="4" height="4" fill="#C7B3E8"/>
            <rect x="40" y="30" width="3" height="3" fill="#2A1F18"/>
            <rect x="52" y="30" width="3" height="3" fill="#2A1F18"/>
            <rect x="38" y="34" width="3" height="2" fill="#FFB6D9" opacity="0.6"/>
            <rect x="55" y="34" width="3" height="2" fill="#FFB6D9" opacity="0.6"/>
            <rect x="32" y="42" width="32" height="20" fill="#C7B3E8"/>
            <rect x="34" y="62" width="6" height="8" fill="#C7B3E8"/>
            <rect x="56" y="62" width="6" height="8" fill="#C7B3E8"/>
            <rect x="44" y="40" width="2" height="2" fill="#FFB6D9"/>
            <rect x="50" y="40" width="2" height="2" fill="#FFB6D9"/>
            <rect x="46" y="42" width="4" height="1" fill="#FFB6D9"/>
          </svg>
          <p class="elephant-caption">小象 / Elephlow</p>
        </div>

        <div class="persona-card">
          <h3 class="card-title">✦ persona ✦</h3>
          <dl class="persona-list">
            <dt>handle</dt><dd>小象 / Elephlow</dd>
            <dt>identity</dt><dd>queer woman ♡</dd>
            <dt>making</dt><dd>推開部屋的門</dd>
            <dt>since</dt><dd>2022.07</dd>
            <dt>season</dt><dd>4 · 2026 啟動 ✦</dd>
            <dt>focus</dt><dd>港台日韓 · 獨立文化邊緣</dd>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <div class="interests-card">
          <h3 class="card-title">✿ 興趣領域 ✿</h3>
          <div class="tag-list">
            <span class="tag">港台流行音樂</span>
            <span class="tag">獨立雜誌與書店</span>
            <span class="tag">紀錄片影展</span>
            <span class="tag">酷兒書寫</span>
            <span class="tag">Zine 與藝術書展</span>
            <span class="tag">東亞文學脈絡</span>
            <span class="tag">同齡女孩對談</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </aside>

      <!-- 中间：5問5答 -->
      <section class="about-center">
        <div class="qa-card">
          <h2 class="qa-title">⌒ 五問五答 ⌒</h2>
          <p class="qa-subtitle">獨自進行的訪談 ｡^‿^｡</p>

          <div class="qa-list">

            <div class="qa-item qa-item-mint">
              <p class="qa-question"><span class="q-icon">☘</span> Q1 · 你是誰？</p>
              <p class="qa-answer">大家好，我是小象（Elephlow）。一個酷兒女性、獨立寫作者，常年穿梭於港台流行文化、獨立出版、影展研究與酷兒書寫之間。網路上找我，在 IG / Threads 叫 <a href="[https://www.instagram.com/icarusrootedbutflow/](https://www.instagram.com/icarusrootedbutflow/)" target="_blank">@icarusrootedbutflow</a>。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-divider">✿ ⋆ ✿ ⋆ ✿</div>

            <div class="qa-item qa-item-aqua">
              <p class="qa-question"><span class="q-icon">✦</span> Q2 · 「推開部屋的門」是什麼？</p>
              <p class="qa-answer">一份創辦於 2022 年 7 月的中文付費電子報。<strong>三季已完結，共 48 期</strong>，第四季 2026 啟動。內容圍繞港台日韓獨立文化的邊緣 ── 書店、Zine、酷兒、聲響、影像。第四季從固定欄目轉向<strong>主題策展</strong>，每一期都像一本小型獨立雜誌的單期：做得窄，做得深。</p>
            </div>

            <div class="text-divider">✦ ⋆ ✦ ⋆ ✦</div>

            <div class="qa-item qa-item-pink">
              <p class="qa-question"><span class="q-icon">✿</span> Q3 · 為什麼寫這份小報？</p>
              <p class="qa-answer">平台的演算法把好東西藏起來，把不需要的東西推到你面前。我想反過來 ── 選好的、慢的、不必走紅但值得看的東西，寫給願意慢下來讀的人。</p>
              <p class="qa-answer">讀者收到的不是熱搜上能看到的東西，而是：</p>
              <ul class="qa-list-inner">
                <li>✿ 打破資訊差的整合性內容</li>
                <li>✦ 不摻商業利益的誠實寫作</li>
                <li>☘ 一個真實的人的陪伴感</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="text-divider">☘ ⋆ ☘ ⋆ ☘</div>

            <div class="qa-item qa-item-cream">
              <p class="qa-question"><span class="q-icon">♡</span> Q4 · 第四季有什麼不一樣？</p>
              <p class="qa-answer">三件大事：</p>
              <ul class="qa-list-inner">
                <li>☘ <strong>正刊轉向主題策展</strong>：每期一個切入點 ── 某件物、某個文學人物、某種音樂風格 ── 當成小型策展的中心。</li>
                <li>✦ <strong>雜誌通信頻率加快</strong>：副刊從月更變成每月多期，每篇 1000 字左右，聚焦某本雜誌的某一期具體在做什麼。</li>
                <li>✿ <strong>外部供稿者加入</strong>：邀請更多中港台寫作者，讓多元、在地的聲音進來。</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="text-divider">♡ ⋆ ♡ ⋆ ♡</div>

            <div class="qa-item qa-item-purple">
              <p class="qa-question"><span class="q-icon">✶</span> Q5 · 怎麼找到我？</p>
              <p class="qa-answer">
                ✉ 訂閱第四季：<a href="[https://tally.so/r/4415XB](https://tally.so/r/4415XB)" target="_blank">tally.so/r/4415XB</a><br/>
                ◉ instagram / threads：<a href="[https://www.instagram.com/icarusrootedbutflow/](https://www.instagram.com/icarusrootedbutflow/)" target="_blank">@icarusrootedbutflow</a><br/>
                ◉ 小紅書：搜「流星小飛象」<br/>
                ◉ 撰稿、採訪、合作邀請：透過上面任一管道私訊
              </p>
            </div>

          </div>

          <div class="qa-footer">
            <p>(｡♡‿♡｡) thanks for reading ✿</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 右侧：minihome 垂直 tabs（繁体 + 强色彩分隔） -->
      <aside class="about-right">
        <nav class="vertical-tabs">
          <a href="/zh-tw/" class="vtab vtab-home">
            <span class="vtab-icon">🏠</span>
            <span class="vtab-label">主頁</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/zh-tw/about" class="vtab vtab-active">
            <span class="vtab-icon">👤</span>
            <span class="vtab-label">簡介</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/zh-tw/archive" class="vtab vtab-archive">
            <span class="vtab-icon">📚</span>
            <span class="vtab-label">目錄</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/zh-tw/guestbook" class="vtab vtab-guestbook">
            <span class="vtab-icon">✉</span>
            <span class="vtab-label">留言板</span>
          </a>
          <a href="[https://tally.so/r/4415XB](https://tally.so/r/4415XB)" class="vtab vtab-subscribe" target="_blank">
            <span class="vtab-icon">★</span>
            <span class="vtab-label">訂閱</span>
          </a>
        </nav>

        <div class="minihome-deco">
          <div class="deco-row">✦ ✿ ☘ ♡ ✦</div>
          <div class="deco-text">
            <p>this is a quiet</p>
            <p>little room ｡^‿^｡</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="season-banner">
          <p class="season-line1">✦ NEW ✦</p>
          <p class="season-line2">SEASON</p>
          <p class="season-line3">04</p>
          <p class="season-line4">2026.05.17</p>
        </div>
      </aside>

    </div>

    <footer class="window-taskbar">
      <div class="taskbar-left">
        <span class="taskbar-start">⊞ START</span>
        <span class="taskbar-item">▣ 關於小象.exe</span>
      </div>
      <div class="taskbar-right">
        <span class="taskbar-status">(｡♡‿♡｡) currently online</span>
        <span class="taskbar-clock" id="clock">--:--</span>
      </div>
    </footer>

  </main>

  <script is:inline>
    function updateClock() {
      const now = new Date();
      const h = String(now.getHours()).padStart(2, '0');
      const m = String(now.getMinutes()).padStart(2, '0');
      const el = document.getElementById('clock');
      if (el) el.innerText = `${h}:${m}`;
    }
    updateClock();
    setInterval(updateClock, 30000);
  </script>

  <style>
    /* === Home Window 容器 === */
    .home-window {
      max-width: 1180px;
      margin: 24px auto;
      background: var(--soft-white);
      border: 2px dashed var(--candy-purple);
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 rgba(199, 179, 232, 0.35);
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .window-titlebar {
      background: var(--candy-mint);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--candy-purple);
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .titlebar-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .title-dots { color: var(--candy-purple); letter-spacing: 2px; }
    .titlebar-text { letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .titlebar-right { display: flex; gap: 4px; }
    .lang-link {
      padding: 2px 8px;
      color: var(--ink);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 3px;
    }
    .lang-link:hover { background: var(--candy-cream); }
    .lang-active { background: var(--candy-cream); font-weight: 700; }

    .window-content { padding: 24px; }

    /* === About 页三栏 === */
    .about-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 240px 1fr 200px;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    /* === 左侧通用卡片标题 === */
    .card-title {
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--ink-light);
      text-align: center;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed currentColor;
    }

    /* === 左侧：像素小象 === */
    .elephant-portrait {
      background: var(--soft-white);
      border: 2px dashed var(--candy-pink);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px 16px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(255, 182, 217, 0.35);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .elephant-portrait svg { width: 120px; height: auto; }
    .elephant-caption {
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--ink-light);
      margin-top: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    /* === Persona card === */
    .persona-card {
      background: var(--candy-mint);
      border: 1.5px dashed var(--candy-purple);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
      box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(199, 179, 232, 0.35);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .persona-list {
      font-family: var(--font-serif-tc);
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin: 0;
    }
    .persona-list dt {
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 9px;
      color: var(--candy-purple);
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .persona-list dt:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
    .persona-list dd {
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-left: 0;
      margin-top: 2px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* === Interests card === */
    .interests-card {
      background: var(--candy-cream);
      border: 1.5px dashed var(--candy-peach);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px;
      box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(255, 200, 200, 0.3);
    }
    .tag-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      background: var(--soft-white);
      border: 1px dashed var(--candy-purple);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-family: var(--font-serif-tc);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    /* === 中间：5問5答 === */
    .qa-card {
      background: var(--soft-white);
      border: 2px dashed var(--candy-mint);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 28px 32px;
      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 rgba(181, 232, 224, 0.4);
    }
    .qa-title {
      font-family: var(--font-serif-tc);
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--ink-light);
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      letter-spacing: 6px;
    }
    .qa-subtitle {
      text-align: center;
      font-family: var(--font-rounded);
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--candy-purple);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .qa-item {
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin: 0 -8px;
    }
    .qa-item-mint   { background: rgba(200, 233, 176, 0.15); }
    .qa-item-aqua   { background: rgba(181, 232, 224, 0.15); }
    .qa-item-pink   { background: rgba(255, 182, 217, 0.15); }
    .qa-item-cream  { background: rgba(255, 233, 182, 0.2); }
    .qa-item-purple { background: rgba(199, 179, 232, 0.15); }

    .qa-question {
      font-family: var(--font-mochi);
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--candy-purple);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .q-icon { margin-right: 4px; }
    .qa-answer {
      font-family: var(--font-serif-tc);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.85;
      color: var(--ink);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .qa-answer:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .qa-answer strong {
      color: var(--ink);
      background: linear-gradient(transparent 60%, var(--candy-aqua) 60%);
    }
    .qa-answer a {
      color: var(--candy-purple);
      border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--candy-purple);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .qa-answer a:hover { background: var(--candy-cream); }
    .qa-list-inner {
      font-family: var(--font-serif-tc);
      font-size: 13.5px;
      line-height: 1.85;
      color: var(--ink);
      padding-left: 0;
      list-style: none;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
    .qa-list-inner li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .qa-list-inner strong {
      color: var(--ink);
      background: linear-gradient(transparent 60%, var(--candy-aqua) 60%);
    }
    .text-divider {
      text-align: center;
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--candy-purple);
      letter-spacing: 6px;
      margin: 16px 0;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }
    .qa-footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px dashed var(--candy-mint);
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--ink-light);
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    /* === 右侧 vertical tabs（每个 tab 不同糖果色背景） === */
    .vertical-tabs {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .vtab {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-radius: 0 16px 16px 0;
      border: 1.5px dashed rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      border-left: 5px solid;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: var(--font-rounded);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 13px;
      transition: transform 0.15s;
      text-shadow: -1px -1px 0 var(--soft-white), 1px -1px 0 var(--soft-white), -1px 1px 0 var(--soft-white), 1px 1px 0 var(--soft-white);
    }
    .vtab:hover { transform: translateX(4px); text-decoration: none; }
    .vtab-icon { font-size: 16px; }

    .vtab-home      { background: var(--candy-mint);   border-left-color: #7BB85E; }
    .vtab-active    { background: var(--candy-purple); border-left-color: #9B7BC9; border-left-width: 7px; font-weight: 800; }
    .vtab-archive   { background: var(--candy-aqua);   border-left-color: #7DC2B8; }
    .vtab-guestbook { background: var(--candy-pink);   border-left-color: #E89BC0; }
    .vtab-subscribe { background: var(--candy-cream);  border-left-color: #E6B870; }

    /* === Deco card === */
    .minihome-deco {
      background: var(--candy-cream);
      border: 1.5px dashed var(--candy-peach);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px 12px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(255, 200, 200, 0.3);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .deco-row {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--candy-purple);
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .deco-text p {
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--ink-light);
      margin: 2px 0;
    }

    /* === Season banner === */
    .season-banner {
      background: var(--candy-purple);
      border: 1.5px dashed var(--ink-light);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px 8px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--candy-pink);
    }
    .season-banner p { margin: 0; }
    .season-line1 {
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--ink);
      letter-spacing: 3px;
    }
    .season-line2 {
      font-family: var(--font-bubble);
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--soft-white);
      text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 var(--ink-light);
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin: 2px 0;
    }
    .season-line3 {
      font-family: var(--font-bubble);
      font-size: 36px;
      color: var(--soft-white);
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--ink-light);
      line-height: 1;
    }
    .season-line4 {
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--ink);
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    /* === Window 任务栏 === */
    .window-taskbar {
      background: var(--candy-mint);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-top: 2px dashed var(--candy-purple);
      font-family: var(--font-pixel);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .taskbar-left { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; }
    .taskbar-right { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; }
    .taskbar-start {
      background: var(--candy-cream);
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      border: 1px dashed var(--candy-purple);
    }
    .taskbar-item, .taskbar-status { color: var(--ink-light); }
    .taskbar-clock { font-weight: 700; }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .about-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .home-window { margin: 12px; }
    }
  </style>

</body>
</html>